title: Sophos Firewall: Temperature
agents: snmp
catalog: hw/network/sophos
license: GPLv2
distribution: https://github.com/KeksDipp/checkmk-plugins
item:
 {CPU} or {NPU}.

description:
 CPU and NPU temperature (sfosXGHardware, SFOS 22.0 and later).
 Default levels: {WARN} at 75 °C, {CRIT} at 85 °C. Configurable via the
 built-in rule "Temperature".

discovery:
 One service is created per sensor that reports a value.
